//// A method called on a number literal (`42.toString()`, front 15's R3 of
//// 1.0.5-beta — the receiver production `test/paren_receiver.bp` pins over a
//// parenthesised expression). The commonJS emitter once wrote
//// `__bp_print(42.toString())`, which node refuses (`42.` reads as a float);
//// the cell pins the answer on every target, a float literal beside it.

pub fn main() {
    @print(42.toString());
    @print(42.toString().length);
    @print(1.5.toString());
}
